@startuml
actor "MES UI (React)" as mes_ui
participant "MES API (C#)" as mes_api
database "Redis Cache" as redis
database "MES-DB (PostgreSQL)" as mes_db
participant "RabbitMQ" as rabbit
participant "CRM API (SpringBoot)" as crm_api

== 1. Чтение списка заказов (GET /orders?status=MANUFACTURING_STARTED) ==
mes_ui -> mes_api: GET /orders?status=MANUFACTURING_STARTED
activate mes_api

mes_api -> redis: GET "orders:list:status=MANUFACTURING_STARTED"
activate redis
redis --> mes_api: {orders: [...]} (HIT) \nили null (MISS)
deactivate redis

alt Cache HIT
    mes_api --> mes_ui: 200 OK + data (из кеша)\n Latency: ~20-50 ms
else Cache MISS
    mes_api -> mes_db: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status = 'MANUFACTURING_STARTED' LIMIT 50
    activate mes_db
    mes_db --> mes_api: rows
    deactivate mes_db

    mes_api -> redis: SET "orders:list:status=MANUFACTURING_STARTED" \nEX 30 (TTL=30s)
    activate redis
    redis --> mes_api: OK
    deactivate redis

    mes_api --> mes_ui: 200 OK + data\n Latency: ~800-2000 ms
end

deactivate mes_api

note right of mes_api
  Ключ кеша включает параметры фильтрации:
  - status
  - page/limit (если пагинация)
  - sort
  TTL = 30 сек — баланс между свежестью и нагрузкой
end note

== 2. Изменение статуса заказа в CRM (MANUFACTURING_APPROVED) ==
"CRM UI (Vue)" -> crm_api: PATCH /orders/ORD-123 {status: "MANUFACTURING_APPROVED"}
activate crm_api

crm_api -> mes_db: UPDATE orders SET status = ..., updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = 'ORD-123'
activate mes_db
mes_db --> crm_api: OK
deactivate mes_db

crm_api -> rabbit: Publish OrderStatusChanged {\n  orderId: "ORD-123",\n  oldStatus: "PRICE_CALCULATED",\n  newStatus: "MANUFACTURING_APPROVED"\n}
activate rabbit
rabbit --> mes_api: Consume event
deactivate rabbit

mes_api -> redis: DEL "order:ORD-123",\n "orders:list:*" (pattern delete via Lua script или отдельные ключи)
activate redis
redis --> mes_api: OK
deactivate redis

crm_api --> "CRM UI (Vue)": 200 OK
deactivate crm_api

note right of mes_api
  Инвалидация:
  - Удаляются все кеш-ключи, связанные с заказом:
    - order:ORD-123 (детали)
    - orders:list:* (все списки, где он мог быть)
  - Не используется Write-Through — инвалидация проще и надёжнее
end note

@enduml